  "description": "Summer Retro is a cheerful and playful comic bubble font designed to bring joy, energy, and creativity to every design. Featuring bold rounded letterforms, glossy bubble-style details, and vibrant retro-inspired personality, this font is perfect for children’s products, birthday invitations, stickers, toy packaging, school projects, comic titles, posters, t-shirts, sublimation designs, and fun branding. Its colorful and friendly appearance instantly captures attention while maintaining excellent readability, making it an ideal choice for projects that need a cute, happy, and memorable look.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Summer Retro is a cheerful and playful comic bubble font designed to bring joy, energy, and creativity to every design. Featuring bold rounded letterforms, glossy bubble-style details, and vibrant retro-inspired personality, this font is perfect for children’s products, birthday invitations, stickers, toy packaging, school projects, comic titles, posters, t-shirts, sublimation designs, and fun branding. Its colorful and friendly appearance instantly captures attention while maintaining excellent readability, making it an ideal choice for projects that need a cute, happy, and memorable look.</p>",
